{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15642","headline":"和王卿立秋即事 · 司空曙","name":"和王卿立秋即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋宜何处看，试问白云官。\n暗入蝉鸣树，微侵蝶绕兰。\n向风凉稍动，近日暑犹残。\n九陌浮埃减，千峯爽气攒。\n换衣防竹暮，沈果讶泉寒。\n宫响传花杵，天清出露盘。\n高禽当侧弁，游鲔对凭栏。\n一奏招商曲，空令继唱难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}